// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

//
// TOTEM - 3 daily layers + 1 hidden admin layer
// BASE = typing
// CODE = symbols + number-row keycodes on a numpad shape
// SYS  = apps/workspaces + sticky mods + browser/system helpers
// ADM  = bluetooth, outputs, F-keys, media, bootloader
//
// Slovak workflow:
// 1) Tap SYS
// 2) Tap G on SYS to send Super+Space and switch GNOME input source
// 3) Use CODE for the number-row keycodes (N1..N0) in a numpad arrangement
// 4) Use Shift for capitals
// 5) Tap SYS + G again to return to English
//
       

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>

#define BASE 0
#define CODE 1
#define SYS  2
#define ADM  3

&caps_word {
    /delete-property/ ignore-numbers;

    continue-list = <BACKSPACE DELETE UNDERSCORE MINUS>;
};

&sl { release-after-ms = <1500>; };

&sk {
    release-after-ms = <1500>;
    quick-release;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        td_code: tap_dance_code {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <180>;
            bindings = <&sl CODE>, <&tog CODE>;
        };

        td_sys: tap_dance_sys {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <180>;
            bindings = <&sl SYS>, <&tog SYS>;
        };

        td_adm: tap_dance_adm {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <180>;
            bindings = <&sl ADM>, <&tog ADM>;
        };

        skm: sticky_key_mod {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-sticky-key";
            #binding-cells = <1>;
            bindings = <&kp>;
            release-after-ms = <1000>;
            quick-release;
            lazy;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        combo_caps_word {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            key-positions = <13 16>;
            bindings = <&caps_word>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };

        combo_lpar {
            timeout-ms = <40>;
            key-positions = <6 7>;
            bindings = <&kp LPAR>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };

        combo_rpar {
            timeout-ms = <40>;
            key-positions = <7 8>;
            bindings = <&kp RPAR>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };

        combo_lbkt {
            timeout-ms = <40>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
            bindings = <&kp LBKT>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };

        combo_rbkt {
            timeout-ms = <40>;
            key-positions = <17 18>;
            bindings = <&kp RBKT>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };

        combo_lbrc {
            timeout-ms = <40>;
            key-positions = <27 28>;
            bindings = <&kp LBRC>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };

        combo_rbrc {
            timeout-ms = <40>;
            key-positions = <28 29>;
            bindings = <&kp RBRC>;
            layers = <BASE>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base_layer {
            bindings = <
         &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E          &kp R      &kp T        &kp Y     &kp U          &kp I      &kp O    &kp P
         &kp A  &kp S  &kp D          &kp F      &kp G        &kp H     &kp J          &kp K      &kp L    &kp APOS
&kp TAB  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C          &kp V      &kp B        &kp N     &kp M          &kp COMMA  &kp DOT  &kp FSLH  &td_sys
                       &mt LCTRL ESC  &kp SPACE  &sk LSHFT    &td_code  &mt LCTRL RET  &kp BSPC
            >;
        };

        code_layer {
            bindings = <
        &kp EXCL   &kp DQT    &kp DLLR              &kp PRCNT  &kp QMARK    &kp ASTRK  &kp N7  &kp N8   &kp N9  &kp MINUS
        &kp AMPS   &kp SQT    &kp NON_US_BACKSLASH  &kp PIPE   &kp CARET    &kp FSLH   &kp N4  &kp N5   &kp N6  &kp PLUS
&trans  &kp TILDE  &kp GRAVE  &kp SEMI              &kp AT     &kp HASH     &kp DOT    &kp N1  &kp N2   &kp N3  &kp EQUAL  &to BASE
                              &trans                &trans     &trans       &trans     &kp N0  &kp RET
            >;
        };

        sys_layer {
            bindings = <
         &kp LG(N1)  &kp LG(N2)       &kp LG(N3)   &kp LG(N4)  &kp LG(N5)       &kp LA(N1)  &kp LA(N2)    &kp LA(N3)    &kp LA(N4)  &kp LA(N5)
         &skm LALT   &skm LGUI        &sk LCTRL    &sk LSHFT   &kp LG(SPACE)    &kp LEFT    &kp DOWN      &kp UP        &kp RIGHT   &kp DEL
&td_adm  &kp LG(N6)  &kp LC(LS(TAB))  &kp LC(TAB)  &kp LC(T)   &kp LC(LS(T))    &kp LC(W)   &kp LS(LEFT)  &kp LS(DOWN)  &kp LS(UP)  &kp LS(RIGHT)  &to BASE
                                      &trans       &trans      &trans           &trans      &kp RET       &kp BSPC
            >;
        };

        adm_layer {
            bindings = <
          &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1  &bt BT_SEL 2  &bt BT_CLR  &out OUT_BLE    &kp F1   &kp F2    &kp F3      &kp F4        &kp F5
          &out OUT_USB  &out OUT_BLE  &none         &none       &none           &kp F6   &kp F7    &kp F8      &kp F9        &kp F10
&to BASE  &none         &none         &none         &none       &none           &kp F11  &kp F12   &kp C_PREV  &kp C_VOL_DN  &kp C_VOL_UP  &bootloader
                                      &trans        &trans      &trans          &trans   &kp C_PP  &kp C_MUTE
            >;
        };
    };
};
